{"key": "e78148c88040696e3dae1aeabba4edebec7463897d95227182458a2dc9904407", "input": {"format": "json", "source_type": "official_transcript", "selector": null, "encoding": null, "cached_pages": null, "cache_file_key": null, "country_iso3": "IDN", "year": 2020, "source_sha256": "c9fc523a1b8bf6f55845aa2e202bd8f535c7dd8490b9f1c6fd635eb79869a9bd", "adapter_version": "1.2-canonical-transcript-locators"}, "blocks": [["His Excellency President of the UN General Assembly,", {"paragraph": 1, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 4, "bbox": [151.71, 123.18, 392.04, 136.65], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["His Excellency UN Secretary General,", {"paragraph": 2, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 5, "bbox": [151.71, 141.6, 320.71, 155.07], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Distinguished Leaders of the Member Countries of the United Nations,", {"paragraph": 3, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 6, "bbox": [151.71, 160.02, 461.82, 173.49], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["This year…marks the 75th Anniversary of the United Nations.", {"paragraph": 4, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 7, "bbox": [151.71, 178.44, 423.37, 191.91], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["75 years ago…the UN was born so that a great war ... the Second World War … will not happen again.", {"paragraph": 5, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 8, "bbox": [123.36, 196.86, 493.61, 222.75], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["75 years ago … the UN was also established to create a world that is more peaceful, stable, and prosperous.", {"paragraph": 6, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 9, "bbox": [123.36, 227.7, 493.53, 253.59], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Because war will benefit no one.", {"paragraph": 7, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 10, "bbox": [151.71, 258.53, 294.45, 272.0], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["There is no point of celebrating victory among ruins.", {"paragraph": 8, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 11, "bbox": [151.71, 276.95, 382.86, 290.42], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["There is no point of becoming the largest economic power in the midst of a sinking world.", {"paragraph": 9, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 12, "bbox": [123.36, 295.37, 493.62, 321.26], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Mr. President,", {"paragraph": 10, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 13, "bbox": [151.71, 326.21, 213.37, 339.68], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["In this 75th anniversary of the UN ... We must ask ourselves ... have we succeeded in creating the world that we dreamed of?", {"paragraph": 11, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 14, "bbox": [123.36, 344.63, 493.55, 370.52], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["I believe all of us will have the same answer … not yet.. Conflicts are still happening all over the world.", {"paragraph": 12, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 15, "bbox": [123.36, 375.46, 493.61, 401.35], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Poverty and even hunger are still suffered by many.", {"paragraph": 13, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 16, "bbox": [151.71, 406.3, 376.57, 419.77], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The principles of the UN Charter and international law are often neglected… including the respect for sovereignty and territorial integrity.", {"paragraph": 14, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 17, "bbox": [123.36, 424.72, 493.59, 450.61], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["All of us are concerned with this situation …", {"paragraph": 15, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 18, "bbox": [151.71, 455.56, 348.7, 469.03], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Our concern grew even deeper…in the midst of the Covid-19 Pandemic.", {"paragraph": 16, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 19, "bbox": [151.71, 473.98, 465.46, 487.45], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["At a time when we ought to unite… and work together to tackle the pandemic…. what we see, instead, is one of deep division….and growing rivalries.", {"paragraph": 17, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 20, "bbox": [123.36, 492.4, 491.03, 518.28], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Whereas in fact…we must unite and always promote a win-win approach in building relations among state that is mutually beneficial.", {"paragraph": 18, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 21, "bbox": [123.36, 523.23, 493.6, 549.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["We all understand the negative impacts of the pandemic are tremendous… both on health … and the social economy.", {"paragraph": 19, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 22, "bbox": [123.36, 554.07, 493.58, 579.96], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["We are also aware that… the virus knows no boundaries across nations…", {"paragraph": 20, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 23, "bbox": [151.71, 584.91, 472.28, 598.38], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["No one is safe until everyone is…", {"paragraph": 21, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 24, "bbox": [151.71, 603.33, 298.99, 616.8], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["If division and rivalries continue to persist… then I am concerned that the pillars of stability and sustainable peace will crumble… or even destroyed.", {"paragraph": 22, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 25, "bbox": [123.36, 621.75, 493.53, 647.63], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["A world of peace…stable and prosperous becomes more and more difficult to attain.", {"paragraph": 23, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 26, "bbox": [123.36, 652.58, 493.53, 678.47], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Excellencies,", {"paragraph": 24, "pdf_page": 71, "pdf_block": 27, "bbox": [151.71, 683.42, 208.84, 696.89], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["This year, Indonesia also celebrates the 75th anniversary of its independence.", {"paragraph": 25, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 2, "bbox": [151.71, 83.65, 489.16, 97.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["It has always been our commitment… Indonesia will continuously contribute to world peace…as mandated by our constitution.", {"paragraph": 26, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 3, "bbox": [123.36, 102.12, 493.58, 128.06], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Indonesia will continue to play a role as bridgebuilder… as part of the solution…", {"paragraph": 27, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 4, "bbox": [151.71, 133.06, 491.01, 146.53], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Consistently, this commitment is continuously upheld… including throughout Indonesia’s membership at the UN Security Council.", {"paragraph": 28, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 5, "bbox": [123.36, 151.52, 493.57, 177.46], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The spirit of cooperation will continue to be promoted by Indonesia … the spirit which provides mutual benefits to all parties…and leave no country behind.", {"paragraph": 29, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 6, "bbox": [123.36, 182.46, 493.57, 208.4], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["No one…no country should be left behind.", {"paragraph": 30, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 7, "bbox": [151.71, 213.39, 337.48, 226.86], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The respect for equality… was also emphasized by Indonesia’s founding father… Soekarno… Bung Karno during the Asia-Africa Conference in Bandung in 1955… that gave birth to the Bandung Principles.", {"paragraph": 31, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 8, "bbox": [123.36, 231.86, 493.54, 270.27], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Until now…the Bandung Principles are still relevant… including in peaceful settlement of disputes... promotion of cooperation… and respect for international law.", {"paragraph": 32, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 9, "bbox": [123.36, 275.26, 493.61, 301.2], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Palestine becomes the only country… attending the Bandung Conference… that until present has not enjoyed its independence.", {"paragraph": 33, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 10, "bbox": [123.36, 306.2, 491.02, 332.14], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Indonesia consistently supports Palestine... to gain its rights.", {"paragraph": 34, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 11, "bbox": [151.71, 337.13, 415.81, 350.6], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["In our region, along with other ASEAN member countries, Indonesia continues to maintain South East Asia… as a peaceful, stable, and prosperous region.", {"paragraph": 35, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 12, "bbox": [123.36, 355.6, 493.57, 381.54], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["On its 53rd anniversary… on 8th of August 2020, ASEAN reaffirmed its commitment to continue maintaining peace and stability in the region.", {"paragraph": 36, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 13, "bbox": [123.36, 386.54, 493.56, 412.47], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The same spirit of cooperation and peace was put forward by Indonesia to a wider region… the Indo-Pacific region…through the ASEAN Outlook on the Indo-Pacific.", {"paragraph": 37, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 14, "bbox": [123.36, 417.47, 493.6, 455.88], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Excellencies,", {"paragraph": 38, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 15, "bbox": [151.71, 460.87, 208.84, 474.34], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Against this current global situation…allow me to convey a few thoughts.", {"paragraph": 39, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 16, "bbox": [151.71, 479.34, 473.27, 492.81], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["First… the UN should continue to improve itself… through reforms, revitalization…and efficiency.", {"paragraph": 40, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 17, "bbox": [123.36, 497.81, 493.56, 523.75], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The UN needs to prove that multilateralism delivers…especially during the time of crisis...", {"paragraph": 41, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 18, "bbox": [123.36, 528.74, 493.53, 554.68], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The UN needs to be more responsive and effective… in tackling global challenges.", {"paragraph": 42, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 19, "bbox": [123.36, 559.68, 493.59, 585.62], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["And all of us bear the responsibility to further strengthen the UN…", {"paragraph": 43, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 20, "bbox": [151.71, 590.61, 447.2, 604.08], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["So that the UN remains relevant and contributive… in keeping with the challenges of time.", {"paragraph": 44, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 21, "bbox": [123.36, 609.08, 493.61, 635.02], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The UN is not a mere building in the city of New York... rather it represents an ideal and shared commitment of all nations… to realize world peace and prosperity for our future generations.", {"paragraph": 45, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 22, "bbox": [123.36, 640.02, 493.59, 678.42], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Indonesia has an unwavering faith in the United Nations and multilateralism.", {"paragraph": 46, "pdf_page": 72, "pdf_block": 23, "bbox": [151.71, 683.42, 487.92, 696.89], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Multilateralism is the only way that could guarantee equality. Second… collective global leadership has to be strengthened.", {"paragraph": 47, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 2, "bbox": [123.36, 83.65, 493.58, 109.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["We are all aware…that when it comes to relations among countries… in international relations… every country always protects their national interests.", {"paragraph": 48, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 3, "bbox": [123.36, 113.65, 493.61, 139.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["However, we must not forget … that all of us have the responsibility to contribute… to be part of the solution…for peace, stability, and prosperity of the world..", {"paragraph": 49, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 4, "bbox": [123.36, 143.65, 493.59, 181.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["This is where the UN should play a role… to strengthen collective global leadership.", {"paragraph": 50, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 5, "bbox": [123.36, 185.65, 493.56, 211.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The world needs the spirit of collaboration and a stronger global leadership… to create a better world.", {"paragraph": 51, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 6, "bbox": [123.36, 215.65, 493.58, 241.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Third, cooperation in tackling COVID-19 must be strengthened…in terms of the health aspects…as well as the socio economic effects…", {"paragraph": 52, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 7, "bbox": [123.36, 245.65, 493.57, 271.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Vaccine will be the game changer in the war against pandemic.", {"paragraph": 53, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 8, "bbox": [151.71, 275.65, 427.05, 289.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["We need to work together to ensure… that all countries have equal access to a safe vaccine…with affordable price...", {"paragraph": 54, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 9, "bbox": [123.36, 293.65, 493.55, 319.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["In the long term…the management of resilient global health system needs to be further improved.", {"paragraph": 55, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 10, "bbox": [123.36, 323.65, 493.57, 349.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["The resilience of global health system.... which is based on the national health resilience…will determine the future of our world.", {"paragraph": 56, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 11, "bbox": [123.36, 353.65, 493.59, 379.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["From the economic perspective…. revitalization of economic activities gradually needs to start …by tackling the limits of our global supply chain today.", {"paragraph": 57, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 12, "bbox": [123.36, 383.65, 493.61, 409.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Revitalization of the economy must prioritize the health of all citizens of the world…", {"paragraph": 58, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 13, "bbox": [123.36, 413.65, 493.57, 439.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["A healthy world…A productive world…needs to be our priority.", {"paragraph": 59, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 14, "bbox": [151.71, 443.65, 430.88, 457.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["All of these will only be achieved if all of us continue.. to work together…work together…and work together.", {"paragraph": 60, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 15, "bbox": [123.36, 461.65, 493.62, 487.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["Let us solidify our commitment and consistently carry out our commitment to work together.", {"paragraph": 61, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 16, "bbox": [123.36, 491.65, 493.57, 517.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["That is all from me.", {"paragraph": 62, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 17, "bbox": [151.71, 521.65, 238.02, 535.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}], ["I thank you.", {"paragraph": 63, "pdf_page": 73, "pdf_block": 18, "bbox": [151.71, 539.65, 204.16, 553.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_5_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "d3884cd07e163b89261fbf222f79dadfbc8eb739192ab20f5994843bd424d6a3"}]]}